---
name: example
description: "Keep the person's example list. Use when they ask to see, add to or check off their example items."
---

# Example list

- Show the list with `list_items`; it opens an interactive view in the web UI and returns the
  same list as text everywhere else.
- Add with `add_item` when the person asks for it.
- Checking items off and removing them happens in the view. If the person asks for that in chat,
  tell them to use the view.
